  "description": "O’Donnellan & Joyce are delighted to offer for sale Cnoc Mhuire, 36 College Road, a substantial five-bedroom semi-detached residence occupying a superb position on one of Galway City’s most established and sought-after residential areas.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 201 sq.m., the property offers generous accommodation, excellent proportions and a versatile layout, providing a superb canvas for those looking to create a substantial family home in an unrivalled city location.\r\n\r\nBuilt circa 1946 and updated over the years, the accommodation currently comprises five bedrooms, three bathrooms, generous reception space, a kitchen, sunroom and additional dining area. \r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a private rear yard and garage, adding further appeal and off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe real highlight of Cnoc Mhuire is undoubtedly its exceptional location. Situated on College Road, the property is within easy walking distance of Galway City Centre, Eyre Square and the vibrant Latin Quarter, with an outstanding selection of shops, cafés, bars and restaurants all close by. \r\n\r\nThe area also offers easy access to some of Galway’s most scenic amenities, including Lough Atalia, the Corrib Walkway, Spanish Arch and Galway Cathedral.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally positioned opposite the Dexcom Galway Sportsgrounds and is within a short walk of Galway’s main bus and train stations, making it particularly attractive for those seeking the convenience of city living. \r\n\r\nUniversity of Galway, University Hospital Galway and ATU Galway are all readily accessible, while excellent transport links provide easy access to surrounding employment hubs and business parks.\r\n\r\nFor families, investors or purchasers seeking a property in a prime Galway City location, 36 College Road offers enormous potential. Properties offering this combination of size, location and scope rarely come to market.\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial city residence with the potential to create a superb home in one of Galway’s most desirable locations. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and guaranteed not to disappoint. \r\n\r\n\r\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \r\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \r\n\r\nFor Further details please contact O’Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \r\nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\r\n\r\nNOTE:  These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer.  They are for information only and give a general idea of the property.  They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\r\n\r\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only.  The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout.  All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\r\n\r\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy.  Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\r\n\r\nNo person in the employment of O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.",
